.TH orgsidian 1  "orgsidian 0.0.0" 
.SH NAME
orgsidian \- Headless CLI for Orgsidian, the org\-mode desktop app
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorgsidian\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Headless CLI for Orgsidian (LD\-27 command tree). The first public artifact: test Orgsidian\*(Aqs org\-mode parsing fidelity on your own .org files before any GUI ships.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
orgsidian\-parse(1)
Parse an org file and print its AST
.SH VERSION
v0.0.0
